{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>灣仔今日（19日）有汽車上的貨物起火。晚上8時28分，一輛客貨車在海底隧道灣仔方向出口近香港遊艇會對開，貨斗突然冒煙，司機及時逃生。</p><p>救護車一度在場戒備，消防到場將火救熄，事件中無人受傷。現場所見，有隧道職員到場協助，貨車貨斗尾板打開，地上有灰燼，其後貨車自行駛離現場。</p><figure><img alt=\"事件中，無人受傷。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200197576285360128259436.jpeg/25i2XVE0b-5tpBWcEbOrV5sz5reHbP2KdpjeIHaY3iA\"/><figcaption>事件中，無人受傷。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"隧道職員在現場協助。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200197572841705472183652.jpeg/uzfEy4gje63s6oqngmu4NzJJOmMc3wXmZMe96GTHveg\"/><figcaption>隧道職員在現場協助。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車貨斗尾門打開，有焚燒痕跡。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200197570496958464396210.jpeg/v1aRXe235OCmv8xBJvpJo_TjIVTFdaVcR5L490eS-Pc\"/><figcaption>貨車貨斗尾門打開，有焚燒痕跡。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車貨斗尾門打開，有焚燒痕跡。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200197567850221568783469.jpeg/OFyzfejNLKv60i5c1nYDG24Kcqjy4U0p22s5jttrOY4\"/><figcaption>貨車貨斗尾門打開，有焚燒痕跡。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.467862+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:39:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:23.964805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:36.125218+00:00","content_hash":"23e4dff281068f513c0306509e80219a3d567afa45e8f93b3438b525f1f1a8ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}